<title>USA: Kleinert Inc no longer publicly traded.</title>
<headline>Kleinert Inc no longer publicly traded.</headline>
<dateline>PLYMOUTH MEETING, Pa. 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kleinert's Inc said on Friday that it had asked the Nasdaq stock market to delist its common stock, and that the company is no longer publicly traded.</p>
<p>In addition, the company said it had accepted for purchase all 290,004 shares from its recent tender offer, to become a private company.</p>
<p>Following the offer, the company said it had about 178 record holders of its common stock.</p>
</text>
